      ],
      "description": "Legends for Supplementary Figures S1-S7 of a human fetal gonad and reproductive tract study, describing UMAP cluster plots, per-donor cell counts, immunofluorescence validation of markers, and DEG/GO heatmaps. S7 is a summary of every marker validated by immunofluorescence, separated by cell type, so it is the quickest route from a marker to its protein-level evidence.",
