      "folds_in_note": "Read whole. Carries names (rete testis, rete ovarii, pre-granulosa, mesonephric epithelial cells, and cluster IDs mCL11, fCL4, m.meCL0/1/3/5, f.meCL0/1/4), markers validated by immunofluorescence, and their tissue location."
